Shared components → native counterparts:
  Spinner→TSSpinner  EmptyState→TSEmptyState  SectionErrorBoundary→ChartContainerErrorState(+retry)
  Button→TSButton  FullscreenButton→ChartContainerFullscreenButton  a11y/VisuallyHidden→fallback table
Charts/maps: none (the surface FRAMES an arbitrary chart; content is a render closure receiving the
  visible annotations — the native port of the web function-children).
i18n keys extracted from source — all resolve through the P1/S10 facade (catalog: ChartContainer.strings):
  annotations.add, annotations.show, annotations.hide, annotations.markerRow, chart.noData,
  errors.section.chartTitle, chart.a11y.fallbackTableLabel ("{{title}} — data table"),
  chart.a11y.summary ("Chart: {{title}}")  — verified by ChartContainerMetaTests.testWebSourceKeysResolve.

=== STATES (every state renders — no hidden surface) ===
  loading  → centred TSSpinner at the figure height
  empty    → TSEmptyState "No data available" (never a blank box)
  error    → ChartContainerErrorState (web SectionErrorBoundary fallbackTitle) + Retry
  ready    → caller chart inside the figure, role-img accessible name
  stale    → connectivity chip (amber) + banner + ONE-shot auto-refresh on the stale edge (re-armed on live)
  offline  → connectivity chip (muted) + banner; action disabled; cached chart kept
  + annotations on/off toggle, collapsed marker row, accessible data-table fallback, annotation footer list,
    add-annotation sheet (label/category/description/date; disabled until valid).

=== ACCESSIBILITY ===
